      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Also, if I search for “low power” on the STM32L4 page, AN4899 is not found:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/79f279c0-367e-4e2b-b9a2-93bb0b9d3e80.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p>But it <strong>is </strong>there - because a search for the App Note number <em>does </em>find it:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/f7530062-7ff1-4c86-bf73-2b06a2329e9d.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p><a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32l4-series/documentation.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32l4-series/documentation.html</a></p></div>"
